# Files that are not shipped to WordPress.org SVN (read by
# 10up/action-wordpress-plugin-deploy and the manual SVN fallback).
# Based on the shared harness template (docs/caller-workflows/.distignore).
# README.md is still shipped, as it is today in SVN trunk. assets/ is
# runtime (the review notice uses assets/plugin-icon.png), so it ships too.

.git
.github
.gitignore
.gitattributes
.distignore
.wordpress-org
CLAUDE.md
readme.md
svn-url
tests
phpcs.xml*
phpunit.xml*
composer.json
composer.lock
package.json
package-lock.json
node_modules
*.map
.DS_Store
.idea
.vscode
